if errors.Unwrap(err) == ErrNotFound { return nil }: the guard tests a different value than err.
At run time this removes the fmt.Errorf-wrapped ErrNotFound (precise answer: ErrTimeout, ErrRateLimited,
*NetError). Keeping ErrNotFound is the sound fallback; the other three must be present in any case.
